ribe what this document covers and who should use it.\"></textarea></div>\n            <div class=\"doc-field full\"><label>Files</label><div class=\"doc-attach-row\"><label class=\"doc-attach-button\" for=\"docFiles\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-upload\"/></svg>Add file(s)</label><input id=\"docFiles\" type=\"file\" class=\"hidden\" multiple accept=\"image/*,.pdf,.ppt,.pptx,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.txt,.csv,application/pdf,application/msword,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document,application/vnd.ms-powerpoint,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation,application/vnd.ms-excel,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet,text/plain,text/csv\"/><div class=\"doc-file-list\" id=\"docFileList\"></div></div><small class=\"doc-field-note\">Accepted: PDF, images, PowerPoint, Word, Excel, text and CSV. Demo stores file names only; actual upload/storage is for the later backend connection.</small></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"doc-form-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"docSaveDraft\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-file\"/></svg>Save Draft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"docPublish\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg>Publish to Employee Library</button></div>\n          <p class=\"doc-demo-hint\">Demo only: publishing updates the summary and front-page library preview in this page. Persistent file storage and live employee delivery will be connected later.</p>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel doc-library-panel\">\n          <div class=\"doc-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">CONTENT MANAGEMENT</span><h2 id=\"docLibraryHeading\">All Documents</h2><p>View, edit, delete or publish documents by category.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"docRecordCount\">8 items</span></div>\n          <div class=\"doc-category-tabs\" id=\"docCategoryTabs\" aria-labe