r work areas, record condition and assign follow-up actions.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span id=\"aiHomeInspectionCount\">5 inspection records</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-ai-page=\"builder\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-layout\"/></svg></span><h2>Form Builder</h2></span><p>Create reusable audit and inspection templates with required fields and dropdowns.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Build or manage templates</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">RECENT ACTIVITY</span><h2>Latest Audit &amp; Inspection Records</h2><p>Sample records from the demo workspace.</p></div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Record</th><th>Type</th><th>Site / Area</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th><th>Open Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"aiRecentActivity\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"auditFormPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Audit Form</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Record audit scope, findings and corrective-action follow-up</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg><div><strong>Safety Audit Register</strong><small>Demo workflow: plan an audit, log findings and maintain action owners and due dates.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo records</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Audit summary\"><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Total Audits</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"auditTotalCount\">5</div><div class=\"stat-period\">All audit types</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-orange\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clock\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Planned / Active</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"auditActiveCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Open for review</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-red\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-alert\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Findings</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"auditFindingCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Logged across audits</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Completed</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"auditCompletedCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Closed / completed audits</div></div></article></section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">NEW AUDIT</span><h2>Audit Details &amp; Findings</h2><p>Choose an audit form and complete its category-specific checklist.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-type-tabs\" id=\"auditFormCategoryChips\" aria-label=\"Choose an audit form\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-checklist-panel\"><div class=\"ai-checklist-head\"><div><strong id=\"auditChecklistTitle\">PPE Audit Checklist</strong><small>Mark each item. Needs Action / Fail entries are counted as findings.</small></div><span id=\"auditChecklistCount\" class=\"case-report-count\">0 findings</span></div><div class=\"ai-checklist-list\" id=\"auditChecklistBody\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-form-grid\"><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"auditTitle\">Audit title</label><input id=\"auditTitle\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"e.g. PPE compliance audit\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditType\">Audit form</label><select id=\"auditType\"><option>PPE</option><option>Tool Tackles</option><option>Lifting Tool</option><option>Housekeeping</option><option>Store Audit</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditDate\">Audit date</label><input id=\"auditDate\" type=\"date\" value=\"2026-10-04\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditSite\">Site / location</label><select id=\"auditSite\"><option>West Bokaro</option><option>Scrap Yard</option><option>Transport Park</option><option>Bog Area</option><option>Workshop</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditDepartment\">Department</label><select id=\"auditDepartment\"><option>Production</option><option>Maintenance</option><option>Transport</option><option>Contractor</option><option>Admin</option><option>HSE</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditAuditor\">Auditor / lead</label><input id=\"auditAuditor\" value=\"Rakesh Kumar\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditPriority\">Highest finding priority</label><select id=\"auditPriority\"><option>Low</option><option selected>Medium</option><option>High</option><option>Critical</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditFindingNumber\">Checklist findings</label><input id=\"auditFindingNumber\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\" readonly/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"auditStatus\">Status</label><select id=\"auditStatus\"><option>Planned</option><option selected>In Progress</option><option>Completed</option><option>Closed</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field full\"><label for=\"auditScope\">Scope / checklist covered</label><textarea id=\"auditScope\" placeholder=\"e.g. PPE, housekeeping, permit-to-work, machine guarding\"></textarea></div><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"auditFindingDetails\">Findings / observations</label><textarea id=\"auditFindingDetails\" placeholder=\"Summarize non-conformances or positive observations\"></textarea></div><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"auditCorrectiveAction\">Corrective action / owner / due date</label><textarea id=\"auditCorrectiveAction\" placeholder=\"Action, responsible person and target date\"></textarea></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-form-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"auditReset\">Reset</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"auditSave\">Save Audit</button></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">AUDIT REGISTER</span><h2>Audit Records</h2><p>Search and manage the demo audit register.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"auditRecordCount\">5 records</span></div><div class=\"ai-toolbar\"><label class=\"ai-search\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg><input id=\"auditSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search audit ID, title, auditor or site...\"/></label><select id=\"auditStatusFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter audit status\"><option value=\"\">All statuses</option><option>Planned</option><option>In Progress</option><option>Completed</option><option>Closed</option></select><span class=\"case-result-count\" id=\"auditFilteredCount\">5 shown</span></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Audit ID</th><th>Audit / Type</th><th>Site / Department</th><th>Auditor</th><th>Date</th><th>Findings</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"auditTableBody\"></tbody></table><div class=\"ai-empty hidden\" id=\"auditEmpty\">No audits match these filters.</div></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"inspectionFormPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-shield-alert\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Inspection Form</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Inspect equipment and work areas, record defects and assign follow-up</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-shield-alert\"/></svg><div><strong>Safety Inspection Register</strong><small>Demo workflow: record pass/fail conditions, defects, responsible actions and target dates.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo records</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Inspection summary\"><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Total Inspections</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"inspectionTotalCount\">5</div><div class=\"stat-period\">All inspection types</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Passed</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"inspectionPassCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Safe / acceptable condition</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-red\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-alert\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Needs Action</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"inspectionActionCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Findings requiring follow-up</div></div></article><article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-orange\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clock\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Open Actions</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"inspectionOpenCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Not yet closed</div></div></article></section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">NEW INSPECTION</span><h2>Inspection Details &amp; Condition</h2><p>Select a checklist and record the inspected vehicle or extinguisher.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-type-tabs\" id=\"inspectionFormCategoryChips\" aria-label=\"Choose an inspection form\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-checklist-panel\"><div class=\"ai-checklist-head\"><div><strong id=\"inspectionChecklistTitle\">Vehicle Inspection Checklist</strong><small>Mark each item. Overall result is calculated from the checklist.</small></div><span id=\"inspectionChecklistCount\" class=\"case-report-count\">0 checked</span></div><div class=\"ai-checklist-list\" id=\"inspectionChecklistBody\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-form-grid\"><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"inspectionAsset\">Asset / area inspected</label><input id=\"inspectionAsset\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"e.g. Vehicle registration / fleet ID\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionType\">Inspection form</label><select id=\"inspectionType\"><option>Vehicle Inspection</option><option>Fire Extinguisher</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionDate\">Inspection date</label><input id=\"inspectionDate\" type=\"date\" value=\"2026-10-04\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionSite\">Site / location</label><select id=\"inspectionSite\"><option>West Bokaro</option><option>Scrap Yard</option><option>Transport Park</option><option>Bog Area</option><option>Workshop</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionDepartment\">Department</label><select id=\"inspectionDepartment\"><option>Production</option><option>Maintenance</option><option>Transport</option><option>Contractor</option><option>Admin</option><option>HSE</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionInspector\">Inspector</label><input id=\"inspectionInspector\" value=\"Amit Kumar\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionResult\">Overall result · automatic</label><select id=\"inspectionResult\" disabled><option>Not Assessed</option><option>Pass</option><option>Needs Action</option><option>Fail</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionPriority\">Priority</label><select id=\"inspectionPriority\"><option>Low</option><option>Medium</option><option selected>High</option><option>Critical</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionDueDate\">Action due date</label><input id=\"inspectionDueDate\" type=\"date\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"inspectionStatus\">Action status</label><select id=\"inspectionStatus\"><option>Open</option><option>In Progress</option><option>Closed</option></select></div><div class=\"ai-field full\"><label for=\"inspectionCondition\">Condition / findings</label><textarea id=\"inspectionCondition\" placeholder=\"Describe condition, defects or safe observations\"></textarea></div><div class=\"ai-field full\"><label for=\"inspectionCorrectiveAction\">Corrective action / owner</label><textarea id=\"inspectionCorrectiveAction\" placeholder=\"Action required, responsible person and due date\"></textarea></div></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-form-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"inspectionReset\">Reset</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"inspectionSave\">Save Inspection</button></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">INSPECTION REGISTER</span><h2>Inspection Records</h2><p>Search and manage the demo inspection register.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"inspectionRecordCount\">5 records</span></div><div class=\"ai-toolbar\"><label class=\"ai-search\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg><input id=\"inspectionSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search asset, inspection ID, inspector or site...\"/></label><select id=\"inspectionStatusFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter inspection status\"><option value=\"\">All action statuses</option><option>Open</option><option>In Progress</option><option>Closed</option></select><span class=\"case-result-count\" id=\"inspectionFilteredCount\">5 shown</span></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Inspection ID</th><th>Asset / Type</th><th>Site / Department</th><th>Inspector</th><th>Date</th><th>Result</th><th>Action Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"inspectionTableBody\"></tbody></table><div class=\"ai-empty hidden\" id=\"inspectionEmpty\">No inspections match these filters.</div></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"formBuilderPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-layout\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Form Builder</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Build reusable custom forms for Audit and Inspection workflows</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-layout\"/></svg><div><strong>Reusable Form Templates</strong><small>Add common field types, set required fields and preview the form before saving it.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo builder</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-builder-layout\">\n          <article class=\"panel ai-panel ai-builder-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">FORM DESIGNER</span><h2 id=\"builderPanelTitle\">Create a Form Template</h2><p>Set a template name, choose where it is used, then add fields.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light btn-small\" id=\"builderReset\">New / Reset</button></div>\n            <div class=\"ai-form-grid\"><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"builderTemplateName\">Template name</label><input id=\"builderTemplateName\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"e.g. Weekly Workplace Audit\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"builderTarget\">Use this form for</label><select id=\"builderTarget\"><option>Audit</option><option>Inspection</option></select></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ai-builder-inline\"><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"builderFieldLabel\">New field label</label><input id=\"builderFieldLabel\" placeholder=\"e.g. Emergency exit clear?\"/></div><div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"builderFieldType\">Field type</label><select id=\"builderFieldType\"><option>Short text</option><option>Long text</option><option>Number</option><option>Date</option><option>Yes / No</option><option>Dropdown</option><option>Checkbox</option></select></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"builderFieldOptions\">Dropdown options <span class=\"ai-help\">Only used for Dropdown fields; separate choices with commas.</span></label><input id=\"builderFieldOptions\" placeholder=\"e.g. Good, Needs Action, Not Applicable\"/></div>\n            <label class=\"radio-wrap\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span><input id=\"builderFieldRequired\" type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Required field</span></label>\n            <div class=\"ai-form-actions\" style=\"justify-content:flex-start\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-soft\" id=\"builderAddField\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg>Add Field</button><span class=\"case-result-count\" id=\"builderFieldCount\">0 fields</span></div>\n            <div id=\"builderFieldList\" class=\"ai-builder-field-list\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ai-form-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"builderSaveDraft\">Save as Draft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"builderPublish\">Publish Template</button></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">LIVE PREVIEW</span><h2 id=\"builderPreviewTitle\">Form preview</h2><p id=\"builderPreviewTarget\">Audit template</p></div><span class=\"comms-chip\">Preview</span></div><div class=\"ai-preview-form\" id=\"builderPreview\"></div></article>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">TEMPLATE LIBRARY</span><h2>Saved Templates</h2><p>Manage templates used for audit and inspection workflows.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"builderTemplateCount\">3 templates</span></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table ai-template-table\"><thead><tr><th>Template ID</th><th>Template</th><th>Used For</th><th>Fields</th><th>Updated</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"builderTemplateBody\"></tbody></table><div class=\"ai-empty hidden\" id=\"builderTemplateEmpty\">No templates match your workspace.</div></div></section>\n        <p class=\"doc-demo-hint\">Demo only: saved templates are kept in this page session. Hooking the builder to production form storage comes with the later Supabase integration.</p>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"dmPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-folder\"/></svg></div><div><h1>DM</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Dedicated workspace placeholder</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-folder\"/></svg><div><strong>DM Workspace</strong><small>This section is ready for the workflow and tools you want to add.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo placeholder</span></div>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">WORKSPACE</span><h2>DM section is ready</h2><p>Tell me what DM should include, and this page can be built out without changing your other dashboard sections.</p></div></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"userAccessPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg></div><div><h1>User &amp; Access Management</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Create users, assign roles and grant or remove workspace permissions</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg><div><strong>Workspace Access Control</strong><small>Manage demo user accounts, role presets, module access and individual actions.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo mode</span></div>\n        <div class=\"ua-security-note\"><strong>Security note:</strong> User and permission management is still a front-end demo. Passwords entered here are checked and discarded; they are not sent to Supabase or stored. The separate Supabase Auth adapter only supports sign-in, sign-out and password change.</div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"User access summary\">\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Total Users</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"uaTotalUsers\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Demo user list</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Active Users</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"uaActiveUsers\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Marked active in demo</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-purple\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Administrators</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"uaAdminUsers\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Assigned admin role</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-orange\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-shield-alert\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Permission Grants</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"uaPermissionGrants\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Across the user list</div></div></article>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\" id=\"uaUserFormPanel\">\n          <div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">USER ACCOUNT</span><h2 id=\"uaFormTitle\">Create a User</h2><p>Set a username and role, then customize what this account can access.</p></div><span class=\"comms-chip\">Create / Edit</span></div>\n          <form id=\"uaUserForm\" novalidate>\n            <div class=\"ai-form-grid\">\n              <div class=\"ai-field span2\"><label for=\"uaDisplayName\">Display name</label><input id=\"uaDisplayName\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"e.g. Rakesh Kumar\"/></div>\n              <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"uaUsername\">Username <span class=\"required\">*</span></label><input id=\"uaUsername\" required minlength=\"3\" maxlength=\"32\" pattern=\"[A-Za-z0-9._-]+\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. rakesh.kumar\"/></div>\n              <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"uaRole\">Role <span class=\"required\">*</span></label><select id=\"uaRole\" required><option>Administrator</option><option>Safety Officer</option><option>Manager</option><option>Supervisor</option><option>Viewer</option><option>Custom</option></select></div>\n              <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"uaStatus\">Account status</label><select id=\"uaStatus\"><option>Active</option><option>Inactive</option></select></div>\n              <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"uaPassword\">Password <span id=\"uaPasswordRequired\" class=\"required\">*</span></label><input id=\"uaPassword\" type=\"password\" minlength=\"8\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\"/><small class=\"ua-form-note\" id=\"uaPasswordHelp\">Required for a new demo user. The value is never saved.</small></div>\n              <div class=\"ai-field\"><label for=\"uaPasswordConfirm\">Confirm password <span id=\"uaConfirmRequired\" class=\"required\">*</span></label><input id=\"uaPasswordConfirm\" type=\"password\" minlength=\"8\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"Re-enter password\"/></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ai-panel-head\" style=\"margin:12px 0 6px\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">PERMISSION ASSIGNMENT</span><h2>Module permissions</h2><p>Select the actions this user may perform. Unchecked actions are not granted.</p></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ua-permission-tools\"><p id=\"uaPermissionPresetNote\">Role permissions are suggested defaults; adjust individual actions before saving.</p><div class=\"ua-permission-buttons\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"uaApplyRoleDefaults\">Apply role defaults</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"uaGrantAll\">Grant all</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"uaClearAll\">Clear all</button></div></div>\n            <div class=\"table-wrap\" id=\"uaPermissionMatrix\"><table class=\"ai-table ua-permission-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sidebar module</th><th scope=\"col\">View</th><th scope=\"col\">Create</th><th scope=\"col\">Edit</th><th scope=\"col\">Delete</th><th scope=\"col\">Publish</th><th scope=\"col\">Export</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"uaPermissionRows\"></tbody></table></div>\n            <div class=\"ai-form-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" id=\"uaResetForm\">Clear form</button><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"uaSaveUser\">Create User</button></div>\n          </form>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\">\n          <div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">USER DIRECTORY</span><h2>Managed Users</h2><p>Review accounts and edit roles or permissions at any time.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"uaUserCount\">0 users</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ai-toolbar\"><label class=\"ai-search\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg><input id=\"uaSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search username, name or role...\"/></label><select id=\"uaRoleFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter by role\"><option value=\"\">All roles</option><option>Administrator</option><option>Safety Officer</option><option>Manager</option><option>Supervisor</option><option>Viewer</option><option>Custom</option></select><select id=\"uaStatusFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter account status\"><option value=\"\">All statuses</option><option>Active</option><option>Inactive</option></select><span class=\"case-result-count\" id=\"uaFilteredCount\">0 shown</span></div>\n          <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table ua-user-table\"><thead><tr><th>User / Username</th><th>Role</th><th>Permission grants</th><th>Password</th><th>Status</th><th>Updated</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"uaUserTableBody\"></tbody></table><div class=\"ua-empty hidden\" id=\"uaUserEmpty\">No users match these filters.</div></div>\n        </section>\n        <p class=\"doc-demo-hint\">Demo only: user records and permission changes remain in this page session. Password values entered here are discarded. Supabase sign-in is configured separately in auth-config.js; this page does not create production accounts.</p>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"dashboardPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-dashboard\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Dashboard</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">SafetyOS workspace overview and shortcuts</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-dashboard\"/></svg><div><strong>Workspace Snapshot</strong><small>Open any module below to review records and continue work.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo data</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Workspace dashboard summary\">\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-cap\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Total Trainings</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"dashTrainingCount\">128</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Month-filtered in Training Management</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-red\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-briefcase\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Safety Reports</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"dashCaseCount\">10</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Employee-front-page submissions</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-orange\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Audits &amp; Inspections</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"dashAiCount\">10</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Registers and demo records</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Published Content</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"dashPublishedCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Communications and library</div></div></article>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"ai-dashboard-grid\" aria-label=\"Dashboard module shortcuts\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-jump-nav=\"Training Management\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-cap\"/></svg></span><h2>Training Management</h2></span><p>Training entry, bulk entry, directory