n audit workspace</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-jump-nav=\"User & Access\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg></span><h2>User &amp; Access</h2></span><p>Create demo accounts and assign role and module permissions.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Manage access</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">RECENT WORKSPACE ACTIVITY</span><h2>Latest Records</h2><p>Recent sample activity across reporting and audit workflows.</p></div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Record</th><th>Module</th><th>Site / Area</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"dashboardActivityRows\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"analyticsPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chart\"/></svg></div><div><h1>View &amp; Analytics</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Cross-module operational summary</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chart\"/></svg><div><strong>Safety Operations Overview</strong><small>Counts are calculated from current demo registers. Training's month-filterable trend remains in Training Management.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo overview</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Operations overview\">\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-briefcase\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Reports Logged</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"overviewReports\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Case Management</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-red\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-alert\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Open Safety Actions</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"overviewActions\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Case, audit and inspection follow-up</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-checkcircle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Published Content</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"overviewPublished\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Employee-facing content</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-purple\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-folder\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Tracked Modules</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"overviewModules\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">With current demo records</div></div></article>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">MODULE SUMMARY</span><h2>Current Workload by Module</h2><p>This page is a text-and-table overview; no training analytics or pie charts are added here.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light btn-small\" data-jump-nav=\"Training Management\">Open Training Management</button></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Module</th><th>Records / Items</th><th>Open / Draft</th><th>Current note</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"overviewModuleRows\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"certificatesPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=