on>\n        <section class=\"panel ai-panel\"><div class=\"ai-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">CERTIFICATE DIRECTORY</span><h2>Employee Certificates</h2><p>Search records, review certificate details or export the demo certificate record.</p></div><span class=\"case-report-count\" id=\"certRecordCount\">0 certificates</span></div><div class=\"ai-toolbar\"><label class=\"ai-search\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg><input id=\"certSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search employee, course or certificate ID...\"/></label><select id=\"certStatusFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter certificate status\"><option value=\"\">All statuses</option><option>Valid</option><option>Expiring Soon</option><option>Expired</option></select><span class=\"case-result-count\" id=\"certFilteredCount\">0 shown</span></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"ai-table\"><thead><tr><th>Certificate ID</th><th>Employee</th><th>Training</th><th>Issued</th><th>Valid Until</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"certTableBody\"></tbody></table><div class=\"ai-empty hidden\" id=\"certEmpty\">No certificates match these filters.</div></div></section>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"exportReportsPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-file\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Export Reports</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Download reports and data snapshots from the demo workspace</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg><div><strong>Local Demo Exports</strong><small>Downloads are generated in your browser. No report is uploaded to a server.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Export center</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-summary-grid\" aria-label=\"Export center summary\">\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-blue\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-cap\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Training Topics</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"exportTrainingCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Directory rows</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-red\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-briefcase\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Case Reports</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"exportCaseCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Case Management</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-orange\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Audit + Inspection</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"exportAuditCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Combined register rows</div></div></article>\n          <article class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-icon stat-green\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-book\"/></svg></div><div class=\"stat-copy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Library Documents</div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"exportDocumentCount\">0</div><div class=\"stat-period\">Published and draft</div></div></article>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"ai-dashboard-grid\" aria-label=\"Available export files\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"training-directory\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-cap\"/></svg></span><h2>Training Directory CSV</h2></span><p>Download the current training topic directory.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download CSV</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"employee-history\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg></span><h2>Employee History CSV</h2></span><p>Download the sample employee training history.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download CSV</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"case-reports\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-briefcase\"/></svg></span><h2>Case Reports CSV</h2></span><p>Export the current employee reporting register.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download CSV</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"audit-inspection\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-clipboard\"/></svg></span><h2>Audit &amp; Inspection JSON</h2></span><p>Download both safety registers as standard JSON.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download JSON</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"published-content\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-message\"/></svg></span><h2>Published Content JSON</h2></span><p>Download released communications and library items.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download JSON</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-report-export=\"all-demo-data\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span><h2>Full Demo Snapshot</h2></span><p>Download a JSON snapshot of the demo registers.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Download JSON</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></button>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"ua-security-note\" id=\"exportReportStatus\" aria-live=\"polite\">Exports are generated locally and do not include user passwords.</div>\n      </main>\n\n      <main class=\"page hidden\" id=\"directEntryPage\">\n        <section class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"heading-left\"><div class=\"heading-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-edit\"/></svg></div><div><h1>Direct Data Entry</h1><p class=\"page-subtitle\">Quick links to the workspace forms that capture safety data</p></div></div></section>\n        <div class=\"ai-source-note\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-edit\"/></svg><div><strong>Quick Entry Hub</strong><small>Choose a form below. Records continue to be managed in their existing demo modules.</small></div><span class=\"case-demo-badge\">Demo workflow</span></div>\n        <section class=\"ai-dashboard-grid\" aria-label=\"Direct data entry form links\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-jump-scroll=\"single-entry\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-cap\"/></svg></span><h2>Training Entry</h2></span><p>Record a training session and employee attendance.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Open training form</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-dashboard-card\" data-jump-scroll=\"bulk-entry\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-head\"><span class=\"ai-dashboard-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-file\"/></svg></span><h2>Bulk Training Entry</h2></span><p>Add multiple employee training records from the spreadsheet-style grid.</p><span class=\"ai-dashboard-card-foot\"><span>Open bulk entry</span><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-chevron-right\"/></svg></span></button>\n          <button typ